# Art references are versioned: the carro/ photos (metadata stripped before
# adding) and the geracoes_carro/, geracoes_piloto/ and geracoes_jogo/ images
# and prompts used to build the car, the driver and the game screens.
# Photos of other people taken by others stay local: Kléber Eletric's (reference for pit-crew.js and
# story-scene.js; one carries a photographer's credit).
/carro/kleber_eletric_*
# Reference photos the players send (e.g. the Chapada's walls, Central de Projetos #5): their authors are unknown.
/fotos_referencia/
# Research write-ups (e.g. "Netcode em jogos de corrida") stay local: not part of the game.
/reports/
/research_notes/
# Progress previews of a work round stay local (the v03 and v04 ones were versioned before this rule).
/geracoes_jogo/*/previas/
# Local model workshop. Runtime copies stay in teste/assets/.
# Unversioned originals remain on disk; keep a separate backup of the workshop.
# Only the editable V4, V5 and V6 car scenes (V6 with its renders) and the scripts that build, check and export them are versioned.
/modelo_3d/*
!/modelo_3d/v04_fechamentos/
/modelo_3d/v04_fechamentos/*
!/modelo_3d/v04_fechamentos/*.blend
!/modelo_3d/v04_fechamentos/README.md
!/modelo_3d/v05_opala_real/
/modelo_3d/v05_opala_real/*
!/modelo_3d/v05_opala_real/*.blend
!/modelo_3d/v05_opala_real/README.md
!/modelo_3d/v06_pecas_separadas/
/modelo_3d/v06_pecas_separadas/*
!/modelo_3d/v06_pecas_separadas/*.blend
!/modelo_3d/v06_pecas_separadas/README.md
!/modelo_3d/v06_pecas_separadas/renders/
!/modelo_3d/scripts/
/modelo_3d/scripts/*
!/modelo_3d/scripts/exportar_glb_jogo.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/remodelar_opala_v05.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/construir_opala_v06.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/v06_*.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/exportar_interior_jogo.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/verificar_opala_v06.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/renderizar_opala_v06.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/exportar_fusca_jogo.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/fusca_cabine.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/fusca_acabamento.py
!/modelo_3d/scripts/renderizar_fusca_jogo.py
# The Fusca V2 (modelo_3d/fusca_v2), modelled from the Type 1's measurements: README, build and check scripts,
# measurement tables and JPEG renders are versioned; its two .blend files (rebuilt by criar_fusca_v2.py) and the
# previews stay on this machine. (The V3 it replaced adapted a BlenderKit model and left the repo on 2026-10-03.)
!/modelo_3d/fusca_v2/
/modelo_3d/fusca_v2/*
!/modelo_3d/fusca_v2/README.md
!/modelo_3d/fusca_v2/*.py
!/modelo_3d/fusca_v2/renders/
/pista_interlagos/teste/assets/piloto/referencia_capacete.jpg

# Servidor das salas (sala-cloudflare): segredos locais e cache do wrangler
.dev.vars
.wrangler/
